flowchart TB
    G[Goal] --> L[Lead Agent]
    L --> D[Developer]
    D --> V[Automated Validation]
    V --> R[Review + Evaluation]

    R --> C{"Does policy require human approval?"}

    C -->|No| M[Merge Eligible]
    C -->|Yes| H[Human Approval]

    H -->|Approve| M
    H -->|Request changes| L
    H -->|Reject| X[Workflow Rejected]
